  <!-- BTG_GuildShuttle, BTG_GuildShuttleIncoming, BTG_GuildShuttleLeaving (ThingDef,
       MayRequire vanillaexpanded.gravship2). These injections mirror the English compat
       root at 1.6/Mods/VanillaGravshipExpanded2/Languages/English/DefInjected/ThingDef/:
       the guild shuttle defs wear VGE2's locked-shuttle art, so they load only from this
       LoadFolders-gated compat root, and MayRequire is honored on defs but IGNORED on
       DefInjected entries, so a main-tree injection would log a found-no-def error for
       every user without VGE2 installed. -->

  <!-- EN: guild shuttle -->
  <BTG_GuildShuttle.label>transbordador del gremio</BTG_GuildShuttle.label>
  <!-- EN: A chemfuel-powered shuttle designed for long-distance travel, built to the pattern the Traders Guild uses across its stations. Its magnetic clamps have been overridden, and it is capable of reaching orbital locations. -->
  <BTG_GuildShuttle.description>Un transbordador impulsado por biocombustible diseñado para viajes de larga distancia, construido según el patrón que el gremio de comerciantes usa en sus estaciones. Sus abrazaderas magnéticas han sido burladas, y es capaz de alcanzar ubicaciones en órbita.</BTG_GuildShuttle.description>
